---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const lang = 'en' as const;
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | New Business Light sarl"
  description="Terms covering use of the New Business Light sarl website."
  lang={lang}
  canonicalPath="/en/terms"
>
  <section class="bg-navy-950 py-14 lg:py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white sm:text-4xl">Terms of Service</h1>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="bg-white py-14 lg:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-6 px-4 text-base leading-7 text-coolgray-700 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <p><em class="text-sm text-coolgray-500">These terms are a working draft and should be reviewed by NBL management before production launch.</em></p>
      <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-navy">Use of this site</h2>
      <p>This website presents New Business Light sarl and its supply, procurement and sourcing services. Content is provided for information purposes. Product availability is subject to specification, sourcing and supplier confirmation.</p>
      <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-navy">Quotations and orders</h2>
      <p>Commercial offers are prepared individually based on submitted requirements and are only binding once confirmed in writing by NBL. Any figure shown on this site is not an offer.</p>
      <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-navy">Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about these terms can be sent to info@newbusinesslight.com.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
